# The one-pass guard never skips, so an operator's prune and a scheduled
# cycle's prune run at once. PruneList(p) plans only while no other pass runs.
# Once a pass has reserved its doomed ids (#5418), a second pass cannot doom
# them, so the skip detector stays green; the listing-window detector holds the
# first pass before it reserves anything, where only the guard serialises them.
MODULE: BackupRetention
ROW: PruneList(p)
FILE: src/lattice.backup/BackupSchedulerGrain.cs
DETECTORS: BackupSchedulerGrainUnitTests.A_retention_pass_is_skipped_while_another_is_in_flight, BackupSchedulerGrainUnitTests.A_retention_pass_plans_from_a_listing_taken_under_the_one_pass_guard
SUMMARY: a second retention pass runs while one is in flight

--- FIND
        if (_pruneInFlight)
--- REPLACE
        if (_pruneInFlight && ScopeKey.Length < 0)
--- END